TITLE 2D transport and cation exchange (PhreeqcMatlab + FVTool example).
# A 5 x 4 = 20-cell grid. SOLUTION 0 is the inflow (CaCl2) imposed on the
# x = 0 face; SOLUTION 1-20 / EXCHANGE 1-20 are the initial per-cell state.
SOLUTION 0  CaCl2 inflow
        units            mmol/kgw
        temp             25.0
        pH               7.0     charge
        Ca               0.6
        Cl               1.2
        density          1.0   calculate
SOLUTION 1-20  Initial solution for the domain
        units            mmol/kgw
        temp             25.0
        pH               7.0     charge
        Na               1.0
        K                0.4
        Cl               1.4
        density          1.0   calculate
END
EXCHANGE 1-20
        -equilibrate 1
        X                0.001
END
SELECTED_OUTPUT
        -reset           false
        -totals          Na Cl K Ca
END
